    "items": [
      "Changing `DLC2EncBandit0NTemplateMagic` (02–06) also needs that rung's boss leaf `DLC2EncBandit0NBoss` (6 · 10 · 16 · 21 · 28, its own rows), which uses it as its template but not for `Stats`; `DLC2EncBandit06TemplateMagic` likewise for CC `ccBGSSSE057_DLC2EncBandit06Boss` (28).",
